Improve your predation by learning from past hunts. You gain [0.18, 0.52, 0.78, 1.01, 1.20 (TL1-5)] accuracy and [0.09, 0.26, 0.39, 0.50, 0.60 (TL1-5)] armor penetration against foes for each foe of that type you have previously slain, to a maximum of [8, 26, 39, 50, 60 (TL1-5)] accuracy and [4, 13, 19, 25, 30 (TL1-5)] apr.
